  "bio": "Marta Derek is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Sóller, Spain, renowned for her mastery in the 'trashpolka' style of tattooing. Her work reflects a distinctive blend of boldness and intricacy, attracting clients who seek out her professionalism and unique artistic touch. Patrons leave her studio not only with striking body art but also with high praise for the cleanliness and hygienic practices upheld throughout their experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Sóller, Balearic Islands, Spain"
